<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Nuraco.Skin - Products</title>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    background-color: #FAF9F6; color: #333333;
  }
  header {
    background-color: #A8C3A5; padding: 1rem 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  }
  header h1 {
    margin: 0; font-weight: 700; color: #FAF9F6;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  nav a {
    color: #FAF9F6; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600;
  }
  nav a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 900px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  h2 {
    color: #A8C3A5; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: center;
  }
  .product-list {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .product-card {
    background-color: white; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .product-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0; color: #333333;
  }
  .product-card p {
    flex-grow: 1; color: #555555;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background-color: #A8C3A5; color: #FAF9F6; padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem; border: none; border-radius: 25px;
    font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    text-decoration: none; text-align: center;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    background-color: #D6CFC7;
  }
  footer {
    background-color: #E6B8B7; color: #333333; text-align: center; padding: 1rem 0; margin-top: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    header {
      flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start;
    }
    nav a {
      margin-left: 0; margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }
    .product-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h1>Nuraco.Skin</h1>
  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="products.html">Products</a>
    <a href="about.html">About</a>
    <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>
<main>
  <h2>Our Products</h2>
  <div class="product-list">
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>Gentle Cleanser</h3>
      <p>A soothing, plant-based cleanser that refreshes all skin types without drying.</p>
      <a href="#" class="btn-primary">Buy Now</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>Hydrating Serum</h3>
      <p>Lightweight serum packed with botanical extracts for deep hydration.</p>
      <a href="#" class="btn-primary">Buy Now</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>Daily Moisturizer</h3>
      <p>Gentle moisturizer that restores softness and balance to your skin.</p>
      <a href="#" class="btn-primary">Buy Now</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
<footer>
  &copy; 2025 Nuraco.Skin. All rights reserved.
</footer>
</body>
</html>
